    Modify this existing thumbnail while strictly adhering to high-end YouTube aesthetics.

    REQUIRED ENHANCEMENTS:
    - Increase overall contrast and color saturation.
    - Apply intense rim-lighting to the modified elements.
    - Ensure razor-sharp focus on the primary subject.
    - Blur the background further to increase depth.
    - COMPOSITE STYLE: Elements should look perfectly integrated into a Photoshop-level production.

    MODIFICATION: "${adjustmentPrompt}"`;

  try {
    const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
      model: 'gemini-2.5-flash-image',
      contents: { 
        parts: [
          { inlineData: { data: cleanBase64(sourceBase64), mimeType: getMimeType(sourceBase64) } },
